#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:114
msgid "Saving Images to New Files"
msgstr "Spara bilder i nya filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:116
msgid ""
"Images in a <application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet can be saved to a "
"new, separate file. The image can be saved either in its original format or "
"in PNG or JPEG formats. The ability to save images to a new file is "
"especially useful when a spreadsheet file has been transferred to a computer"
" that does not have a copy of the original image."
msgstr ""
"Bilder i ett <application>Gnumeric</application>-kalkylblad kan sparas i en "
"ny, separat fil. Bilden kan sparas i originalformatet eller som PNG eller "
"JPEG. Det är särskilt användbart att kunna spara bilder i en ny fil när ett "
"kalkylblad har överförts till en dator som saknar originalbilden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:125
msgid ""
"Images above a worksheet can be saved by accessing the context menu, "
"selecting the many entry and navigating the file saving dialog which "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"Du kan spara bilder som ligger ovanför kalkylbladet genom att öppna "
"snabbmenyn, välja menyalternativet för att spara bilden och sedan navigera i"
" dialogrutan som visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:132
msgid "Procedure to save a worksheet image."
msgstr "Så här sparar du en bild från kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:134
msgid "Open the context menu"
msgstr "Öppna snabbmenyn"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:135
msgid ""
"The context menu is opened by placing the mouse cursor over the image and "
"clicking one of the secondary mouse buttons."
msgstr ""
"Öppna snabbmenyn genom att föra muspekaren över bilden och klicka med en "
"sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:142
msgid "Select the <guimenuitem>\"Save As\"</guimenuitem> menu item"
msgstr "Välj menyalternativet <guimenuitem>\"Spara som\"</guimenuitem>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:145
msgid ""
"Once the context menu appears, the mouse cursor can be moved over the menu. "
"As the cursor passes over each menu item, that item will be highlighted. "
"When the <guimenuitem>Save As</guimenuitem> menu item is highlighted, "
"clicking with the primary mouse button will select that entry, causing the "
"context menu to disappear and the <interface>Save As</interface> dialog to "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"När snabbmenyn visas kan du föra muspekaren över alternativen. Varje "
"alternativ markeras när pekaren passerar över det. När <guimenuitem>Spara "
"som</guimenuitem> är markerat väljer du det genom att klicka med den primära"
" musknappen. Snabbmenyn stängs och dialogrutan <interface>Spara "
"som</interface> öppnas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:157
msgid "Select the file name and location"
msgstr "Välj filnamn och plats"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:158
msgid ""
"The <interface>Save As</interface> dialog which opens will depend on the "
"platform that the user is using but should be standard for that platform. "
"The dialog should allow a user to define a name for the file, to select the "
"folder (directory) in which a file will be saved, and to select the format "
"for the saved file. When all these selections have been made, the "
"<guibutton>Save</guibutton> can be pressed which will dismiss the dialog and"
" save the file."
msgstr ""
"Den öppnade dialogrutan <interface>Spara som</interface> beror på "
"operativsystemet, men följer dess vanliga utformning. Där kan du ange "
"filnamn, välja mappen (katalogen) där filen ska sparas och välja filformat. "
"När du har gjort dina val klickar du på <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>. "
"Dialogrutan stängs och filen sparas."
